Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.79,0:00:10.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Utilizing otherworlders is a designated taboo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.79,0:00:13.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Using the human body as material is also taboo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.17,0:00:16.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that you have committed these offenses...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.75,0:00:18.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I must kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:31.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Flare's successor, Flarette...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:36.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The blank white material you once were\Nhas become so much like that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:41.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've waited eagerly these past ten\Nyears for you to grow into your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.75,0:00:47.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All the while conducting repeated\Nexperiments on erasing personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.46,0:00:51.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:56.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One time, I went too far and blanched\Npart of the Pure Concept itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.13,0:00:58.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,which was quite the disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:00.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you know about that all too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:08.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the time an otherworlder's powers\Nturned a makeshift [White] and wiped out an entire town.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.79,0:01:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Flare was the only one...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.04,0:01:14.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who suspected me at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.67,0:01:23.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You... did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.54,0:01:25.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.42,0:01:29.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You poor thing,\Nthe girl who failed to share the fate of her hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.79,0:03:21.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Momo! What is this thing?! How do I kill it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.75,0:03:25.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.75,0:03:28.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I assume it has something to do with original sin,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.79,0:03:31.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but if you can't defeat it why don't you just let it kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.63,0:03:36.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry and get to Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.71,0:03:43.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Otherworlder. You'll soon forget everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.33,0:03:47.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.42,0:03:51.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:54.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.79,0:04:21.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This place...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.25,0:04:26.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. It's the cathedral in Garm!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:27.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.63,0:04:28.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.88,0:04:34.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is my present from Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.29,0:04:39.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't manage to get this that often.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.88,0:04:43.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you to stay still!\NDo you want to experience more pain?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.13,0:04:47.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then this is where I resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:58.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:05:01.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of going with\Nanyone other than Menou...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.21,0:05:06.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But more importantly,\NI absolutely refuse to let anyone but Menou kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:18.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No good, huh? It's still moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.29,0:05:21.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've never been able to stop this thing,\Nno matter how many times I try.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.96,0:05:23.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.83,0:05:33.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess I don't have to rewind things this Time,\Nunlike back on the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:38.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess the best thing to do is\Nhave that girl wreak havoc?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.42,0:05:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is this a little mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.00,0:05:52.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it's not really fair that she gets to have those ribbons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:54.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:05:58.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, time to do my thing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.17,0:06:05.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's okay. I'll leave a sense of déjà vu, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.33,0:06:08.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And my love for Menou, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.67,0:06:10.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So there's nothing to be scared of.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.67,0:06:20.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wasn't I in a really bad situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.79,0:06:23.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever. I guess I managed to get out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:32.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good grief. This is getting nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:38.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a pathetic flame!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.50,0:06:40.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The barrier my robe provides is more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.54,0:06:56.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:01.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess that killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.33,0:07:11.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why? Why...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.88,0:07:16.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I swear I protected them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:19.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So how...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.33,0:07:20.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.63,0:07:23.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This... isn't fair...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:26.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, no, noooo!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:37.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I got them... from Menou...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.67,0:07:40.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're the world's most precious...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.17,0:07:42.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Were the more precious...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:44.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.67,0:07:55.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Die, die, die, die! Just die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:03.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How dare you...! It's all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:17.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-what's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.38,0:08:19.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo! Not the earthen vein?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.58,0:08:21.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't, the entire castle will crumble on our heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.88,0:08:23.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Shut up, keep out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:23.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:26.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hate everyone! Except Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I love everything about her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.04,0:08:33.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So you'll pay for this! I swear. I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.33,0:08:35.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hate you all! So much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.17,0:08:38.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Except for Menou, you can all just die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.25,0:08:59.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow Momo, you really went all out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:05.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was wrong to hold back to preserve the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:07.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a den of corruption, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.33,0:09:09.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Allow me to go full force on this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:24.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stand back, riff-raff! I can't promise you won't get hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:27.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now then, demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.33,0:09:29.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Surely even you will die if I reduce you to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.88,0:09:48.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Slashing through history is enthralling indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.92,0:09:57.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're not being very aggressive, Ms. Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:10:03.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're quite adept at controlling ether\Nbut don't have much of it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.88,0:10:07.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'll eventually run out. What do you plan to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.58,0:10:16.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She separated me from Menou,\Nand made these stupid things attack me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.33,0:10:18.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's all... all because of...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:25.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All because of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.42,0:10:29.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll eliminate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.42,0:10:43.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someone broke the barrier?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.21,0:10:49.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, if there's one thing I can brag about...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:52.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's my aide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.33,0:10:53.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's the world's most competent-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:55.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.33,0:10:59.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.75,0:11:02.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If anything happened to you, Menou...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.71,0:11:08.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you come here for, you dummy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.46,0:11:21.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why are you angry, Menou?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.50,0:11:23.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you to run?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.50,0:11:24.42,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,I couldn't just leave you behind! I did the right thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.42,0:11:26.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How did that girl get away?!\N{\rSubtitle-2}I couldn't just leave you behind! I did the right thing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.54,0:11:28.13,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Will you just shut up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.25,0:11:39.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you doing, Menou?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.67,0:11:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What just happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.50,0:11:47.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you just hear something that sounded like crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.63,0:12:00.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you hear that awful sound?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.50,0:12:05.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Very competent, indeed, with copious amounts of ether.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:08.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But at this rate, she'll wear herself out before long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:12.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I should still take care of you first, Ms. Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.79,0:12:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:18.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari, why would you come when you\Nknow it's going to be dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:25.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, because the safest place I know in\Nthis world is right by your side, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.38,0:12:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're such an idiot. But it's fine.\NYou've given me an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.67,0:12:49.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You and your diversions. Just like Flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:54.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you intend to use the dregs of [Red]\Nleft behind with what little ether you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.17,0:12:55.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Very predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:12:56.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.71,0:12:58.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But this is what I'm really after!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.13,0:13:09.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't let my guard down for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.08,0:13:11.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It seems I should put an end to this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.67,0:13:18.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Flare?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.38,0:13:20.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:23.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me it was you disguised\Nas Ms. Menou all along,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.88,0:13:26.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so that you could approach me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.96,0:13:31.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're right, I do love using diversions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.13,0:13:36.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.38,0:13:38.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Etheric camouflage!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:41.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari! I'm going to borrow your ether!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.92,0:13:51.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You have nothing protecting you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.42,0:14:06.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness I'm the archbishop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.92,0:14:10.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The magecraft built into this cathedral protected me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.71,0:14:13.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,An automatic system to guard dignitaries...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.96,0:14:16.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You were so close, Ms. Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.21,0:14:19.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now this is really it for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:22.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm out of options.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.71,0:14:27.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Except for the most dangerous one,\Nthe one I most wanted to avoid...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.92,0:14:33.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I have to use more than just Akari's ether,\Nbut her Pure Concept itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.25,0:14:36.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and dive deep into her consciousness to do so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.71,0:14:40.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even if it's strictly forbidden, I have to!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.00,0:14:45.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:15:00.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's swallowing me in...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.33,0:15:09.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where... am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.33,0:15:13.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.29,0:15:23.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I failed to become a villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.13,0:15:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A part of me never stopped longing to be a\Npriestess who was simply pure, just, and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.71,0:15:38.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even though my life has only ever had\Nmeaning on this dark red path I'm on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.50,0:15:56.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I die now, can I go to that classroom over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.50,0:16:00.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.13,0:16:07.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.67,0:16:11.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No matter who does what,\Nand whatever Time it might be...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.67,0:16:15.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll always be your best friend, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.21,0:16:20.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.50,0:16:25.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're right. Thanks, Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.96,0:16:52.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh... why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:57.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm different from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.50,0:17:04.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I helped so many people... so I deserve to live...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:07.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Archbishop Orwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.38,0:17:11.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,With such strong desire,\Nwhy didn't you use your scripture?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.63,0:17:15.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because I believed...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.33,0:17:22.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That if I cast aside all that was just and pure,\NI would find my own path to follow...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:29.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Meaning I never found in my life\Nwhere I was nothing but righteous...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.54,0:17:33.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Ms. Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.54,0:17:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your life has been the polar opposite of mine.\NDo you have an answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.88,0:17:43.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.83,0:17:44.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:47.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From the very beginning, I've-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.08,0:18:06.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've worn yourself out after your little rampage, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.21,0:18:10.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I quite enjoyed fighting alongside you, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.17,0:18:22.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A dragon and a demon suddenly\Nemerged from underground,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.17,0:18:27.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and the Princess Knight Ashuna Grisarika\Ndefeated them with the help of a priestess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.42,0:18:31.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In the midst of it all,\NArchbishop Orwell was killed in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was the story told to the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.38,0:18:41.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The archbishop's heretical crimes have been\Nconcealed by the Church's higher ups,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.42,0:18:44.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,never to be uncovered again, I imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.63,0:18:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.67,0:18:49.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.54,0:18:55.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, the ribbons you gave me...\NTh-they burned away...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.58,0:19:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When they were a gift from you I treasured\Nmore than anything in the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.58,0:19:04.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo, turn around and close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:11.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You look cute, Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:13.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.29,0:19:18.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How do you always give me what\NI want when I need it most?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.92,0:19:20.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:22.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because I'm your mentor, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.21,0:19:24.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I love you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.75,0:19:29.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The only person I love in the whole wide world is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.42,0:19:36.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think Akari must have regressed back from\Na future far beyond this point in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.54,0:19:41.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But even though she forgot\Neverything from before she regressed,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.46,0:19:43.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,her affection for me remained somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.75,0:19:48.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So you think that's why the girl\Ntrusted you from the beginning?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.13,0:19:50.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.33,0:19:54.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's what I sensed when I made contact with\Nthe depths of her soul and consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.25,0:20:00.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My future self managed to deceive\NAkari so well to earn that much trust,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.42,0:20:05.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I must have failed to kill her for some\Nreason and allowed her to regress back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.71,0:20:07.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.42,0:20:15.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep going on this journey with Akari,\Nin order to find a way to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.29,0:20:21.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, Menou...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.88,0:20:23.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No... No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:25.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.67,0:20:27.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it, Akari?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.75,0:20:29.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're finally up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.21,0:20:37.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.88,0:20:40.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.29,0:20:43.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just... had a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.08,0:20:45.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A nightmare? What kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.46,0:20:46.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:50.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I love you so much, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.17,0:20:53.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine, fine. You're very welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.33,0:20:59.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.46,0:21:00.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should know...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.75,0:21:02.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was trying to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.17,0:21:11.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That would have been fine.\NYou should have just killed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.83,0:21:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No way. Not when I finally learned... what friendship is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.38,0:21:18.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.63,0:21:28.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.17,0:21:36.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No. If this is how things end...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.25,0:21:46.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I'm going to be killed by the likes of her,\NI wanted Menou to kill me instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.29,0:21:50.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So long, you incomplete concept of Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.17,0:22:03.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So please, make sure you kill me properly this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.50,0:22:05.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.42,0:23:39.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next episode: Port City of Libelle.
